    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm seeing some really strange spikes in the salinity sensor readings around the 2000m mark, though. The values jump up and down erratically in a way that doesn't seem to align with the temperature profile or the surrounding water mass. Do you have any idea what might cause such inconsistent data in a stable environment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
